<title>USA: NatWest Markets named head of U.S. stock research.</title>
<headline>NatWest Markets named head of U.S. stock research.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Markets, a unit of National Westminster Bank Plc, said Tuesday it hired Deborah Bronston as managing director and director of U.S. equities research.</p>
<p>Bronston, who had been with Prudential Securities Inc, will report to Edmond Warner, global head of research.</p>
<p>At Prudential Securities, Bronston had been a managing director and associate director of research.</p>
